{"author":{"id":"2eecc7d99b502c158aacb0868dca9358610edc02724d21fe49b0196402d3364e"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1792933635,"nonce":"mvNpegcxr2P6NNY3L04rs+1Zir8=","title":"Found by the final red team of AFK run 20261024-1951 (branch fix/open-bugs, report review/redteam-final.md, finding F4). MED.","message":"`finalize_step` (scheduler.rs ~4971) and `rearm_step` (~4710) call `commit_step_transition` with `AttemptFrontier::Any`. `succeed_step` / `settle_failed_attempt` read the latest attempt, then await more I/O (on the deploy-incomplete path a backend call). If the run is cancelled, rerun and the step claimed on a2 inside that window, the swap matches a2's `Running` and finalizes the step on a1's stale verdict: the run settles Failed while a2's unit is live, no teardown is owed, a2 shows Running forever, and a deploy target's concurrency hold drops while a2 deploys.\n\nFix: pass `AttemptFrontier::Is(Some(attempt))` at both sites (round 3 did this only for cancel and re-arm).\nRepro (ignored): crates/scarab-server/tests/redteam_open_bugs_final.rs `a_stale_verdict_cannot_finalize_the_reruns_step` (pg + inmemory).","files":null}]}